  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed operation will support policy and institutional reforms to: i) improve the environment for private sector-driven recovery and growth; (ii) strengthen the management of SOEs and fiscal risks, and improve fiscal transparency, and (iii) boost economic resilience.</narrative>
